NCT05433597.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. ≥18 years old and ≤60 years old;
2. Pathologically confirmed nasopharyngeal carcinoma;
3. Patients with primary locally advanced non-metastatic nasopharyngeal carcinoma who were eligible for standard concurrent radiotherapy and chemotherapy were in line with stage III and IVA defined by the International Union against Cancer and American Joint Commission on Cancer (UICC/AJCC) staging System (version 8) (note: Stage III only included EBV-DNA\>1×10\^4 copy/mL).
